-- Routes for the demo home entities the device-simulator publishes under
-- gateway 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001 (the simulated-gateway seed
-- in the ingest-service). The demo home seed (20261008200000) routes only
-- the two legacy uuid temperature ids; these routes send the Home Assistant
-- style entity ids to their seeded devices, so live readings update the
-- seeded entities instead of auto-provisioning placeholders in the default
-- home. Idempotent: a route already claimed keeps its owner.

ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;